    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nON VIEW BY PRIVATE APPOINTMENT\n\n***Register your interest on www.drummartin-heights.ie to request a call back***\n\nIntroducing Drummartin Heights, an exclusive collection of 47 luxury apartments and penthouses by Sorohan. Perfectly positioned near Dundrum and Stillorgan Villages, Dundrum Town Centre, and the Kilmacud Luas stop, these homes place every convenience right at your doorstep.\n\nThe development features A-rated 1- and 2-bedroom apartments, 2-bedroom plus study homes, and 3-bedroom penthouses, many offering stunning sea views on one side and mountain or city outlooks on the other. All homes are thoughtfully designed around a private, elevated courtyard garden, combining style, comfort, and exceptional attention to detail.\n\nContemporary architectural design is complemented by exceptional specification, finish, and craftsmanship throughout. Each home is carefully crafted to offer spacious layouts, elegant interiors, and meticulous attention to detail, providing a living experience defined by comfort, sophistication, and superior quality.\n\nDrummartin Heights enjoys a highly convenient location, with local shopping available in Goatstown and Kilmacud, complemented by the extensive facilities of Dundrum Town Centre and Stillorgan Shopping Centre. The Kilmacud Luas stop is just a short walk away, and a wide range of sporting and leisure amenities are nearby. Award-winning Dundrum Town Centre is within easy reach, offering designer shops, restaurants, and a Multiplex cinema. Several of South Dublin's most prestigious primary and secondary schools are close by, while the improved road network provides effortless access to the M50.\n\nA wonderful opportunity to put down roots in an unrivalled location viewing is advised.\n\nPlease call Sherry FitzGerald New Homes on 01-6671888 for more information."
      },
